        "TileImage": "$($repository 6e5c017a-a08f-4dbb-97d4-a384c9057475).Image",
        "Description": "Five women. Five names. One face.\n\n\rMaria, Barbara, Anna, and two Paolas are scattered across the sunny streets of Sapienza. Different lives, different routines, yet an uncanny resemblance connects them all.\n\n\r\rCoincidence? A family secret? Or has someone been making copies?\n\n\r\rAgent 47, find all five and eliminate every copy. Leave no duplicates behind.",
